 "expected_r_rule": "a passed alpha's kill-switch expectation (evidence.json avg_r) = min(TRAIN avg_r, VALID avg_r)",
 "numbers": "pooled over all trades as rounded in the result files (avg_r 4 decimals, t_day 2 decimals); years by entry time",
 "valid_runs": "2026-10-11 19:59..20:10 UTC, commit 81de74a (git_dirty false), --workers 3, one run per candidate; the scratch --trades-out lists are output only",
 "audit": {
  "verdict": "no look-ahead or protocol defect found; no candidate disqualified before VALID",
  "inventory": "every docs/results/p2_<family>_*.json lab result matches a ledger line (config hash, utc, n, avg_r, t_day); screen files match the ledger screen lines; ledger code hashes equal the committed alpha files; no VALID or 2025 evaluation before the gate (no seal ledger)",
  "causality": "closed bars only via the cursor (1h / 4h / 1d decision on the minute the bar closed, the daily frame cursor never reaches an unclosed day), ctx.market = last hour close at or before the decision, ctx.extras = 5m rows usable from bucket start + 5 min; tests/test_p2_gate.py sweeps decisions cut exactly at the decision bar for all four (a mutation that lets the daily cursor see the open day fails it for the three long-frame alphas)",
  "shared_approximation": "ctx.funding_rate in backtests blends the last settled rate linearly towards the next charged rate (backtester._upcoming_funding_rate): at the mid-window 4h decisions (03:59, 11:59, 19:59) the fund_max filter sees half of a rate settled 4h later; it flips the filter on 1,671 of 127,226 side-decisions in TRAIN (1.3%); ts_trend decides 1 min before settlement where live and backtest agree",
  "selection_notes": [
   "ts_trend: the renewal fix (hold - 1 min) came after the first lab run, recorded as a new trial",
   "positioning_flow: direction reversed from the rejected H1, four choices after one screen each",
   "vol_breakout: the candidate switches the family's compression premise off (comp_q = 1.0); ts_trend + vol_breakout pooled N = 50 keeps the bar at 3.00",
   "discovery_daily: thresholds mined on 2022-2023 (in-sample part of TRAIN), bar 4.81"
  ],
  "no_symbol_or_year_logic": true
 },
